YO HOWSURDOIN 0.1

IWANNACOMENT:
COSSERT TIC TAC TOE - HUMAN VS HUMAN OR HUMAN VS AI
X IS ALWAYS THE FIRST PLAYER.
IN AI MODE THE HUMAN IS X AND THE AI IS O.
THE AI TRIES TO WIN, THEN BLOCK, THEN TAKES CENTER, CORNERS, AND EDGES.
THERE IS STILL NO ELSE IF BECAUSE COSSERT ENJOYS SUFFERING.
COMENT FINISH

HAV A LIST "board" LIKE ["0", "1", "2", "3", "4", "5", "6", "7", "8"]:

GET "gameMode" LETITB 0
GET "turn" LETITB "X"
GET "move" LETITB 0
GET "cell" LETITB ""
GET "movesMade" LETITB 0
GET "newCount" LETITB 0
GET "won" LETITB 0
GET "ignore" LETITB 0
GET "aiMove" LETITB -1
GET "oldTurn" LETITB ""
GET "c0" LETITB "0"
GET "c1" LETITB "1"
GET "c2" LETITB "2"
GET "c3" LETITB "3"
GET "c4" LETITB "4"
GET "c5" LETITB "5"
GET "c6" LETITB "6"
GET "c7" LETITB "7"
GET "c8" LETITB "8"

IWANNACOMENT:
SNAPSHOT READS EVERY BOARD SLOT USING TAKITOUT, THEN PUTS IT BACK.
THIS IS HOW COSSERT READS A LIST WITHOUT PERMANENTLY DESTROYING IT.
COMENT FINISH

ELLO "SNAPSHOT" YOUR NOW DOIN {
    "c0" CHANGETO-> TAKITOUT{board}[0]
    "c1" CHANGETO-> TAKITOUT{board}[1]
    "c2" CHANGETO-> TAKITOUT{board}[2]
    "c3" CHANGETO-> TAKITOUT{board}[3]
    "c4" CHANGETO-> TAKITOUT{board}[4]
    "c5" CHANGETO-> TAKITOUT{board}[5]
    "c6" CHANGETO-> TAKITOUT{board}[6]
    "c7" CHANGETO-> TAKITOUT{board}[7]
    "c8" CHANGETO-> TAKITOUT{board}[8]
    UREPLACEIT{board}[0] W/c0
    UREPLACEIT{board}[1] W/c1
    UREPLACEIT{board}[2] W/c2
    UREPLACEIT{board}[3] W/c3
    UREPLACEIT{board}[4] W/c4
    UREPLACEIT{board}[5] W/c5
    UREPLACEIT{board}[6] W/c6
    UREPLACEIT{board}[7] W/c7
    UREPLACEIT{board}[8] W/c8
    FINALANSER(0)
}

ELLO "SHOWBOARD" YOUR NOW DOIN {
    GET "snapShow" LETITB SNAPSHOT()
    GET "r0a" LETITB YO COMBINE c0 W/" | "
    GET "r0b" LETITB YO COMBINE r0a W/c1
    GET "r0c" LETITB YO COMBINE r0b W/" | "
    GET "row0" LETITB YO COMBINE r0c W/c2
    GET "r1a" LETITB YO COMBINE c3 W/" | "
    GET "r1b" LETITB YO COMBINE r1a W/c4
    GET "r1c" LETITB YO COMBINE r1b W/" | "
    GET "row1" LETITB YO COMBINE r1c W/c5
    GET "r2a" LETITB YO COMBINE c6 W/" | "
    GET "r2b" LETITB YO COMBINE r2a W/c7
    GET "r2c" LETITB YO COMBINE r2b W/" | "
    GET "row2" LETITB YO COMBINE r2c W/c8
    SPITOUT("")
    SPITOUT(row0)
    SPITOUT("--+---+--")
    SPITOUT(row1)
    SPITOUT("--+---+--")
    SPITOUT(row2)
    SPITOUT("")
    FINALANSER(0)
}

ELLO "CHECKWIN" YOUR NOW DOIN {
    GET "snapWin" LETITB SNAPSHOT()
    HMM WATIF(c0 == turn)
        HMM WATIF(c1 == turn)
            HMM WATIF(c2 == turn)
                FINALANSER(1)
    HMM WATIF(c3 == turn)
        HMM WATIF(c4 == turn)
            HMM WATIF(c5 == turn)
                FINALANSER(1)
    HMM WATIF(c6 == turn)
        HMM WATIF(c7 == turn)
            HMM WATIF(c8 == turn)
                FINALANSER(1)
    HMM WATIF(c0 == turn)
        HMM WATIF(c3 == turn)
            HMM WATIF(c6 == turn)
                FINALANSER(1)
    HMM WATIF(c1 == turn)
        HMM WATIF(c4 == turn)
            HMM WATIF(c7 == turn)
                FINALANSER(1)
    HMM WATIF(c2 == turn)
        HMM WATIF(c5 == turn)
            HMM WATIF(c8 == turn)
                FINALANSER(1)
    HMM WATIF(c0 == turn)
        HMM WATIF(c4 == turn)
            HMM WATIF(c8 == turn)
                FINALANSER(1)
    HMM WATIF(c2 == turn)
        HMM WATIF(c4 == turn)
            HMM WATIF(c6 == turn)
                FINALANSER(1)
    FINALANSER(0)
}

ELLO "HUMANMOVE" YOUR NOW DOIN {
    GOAROUND 100 TIMES:
        YO USER DILE("Choose square 0-8: "): move
        HMM WATIF(move < 0)
            SPITOUT("NOPE. IDs START AT 0.")
            SKIPTIS
        HMM WATIF(move > 8)
            SPITOUT("NOPE. IDs END AT 8.")
            SKIPTIS
        "cell" CHANGETO-> TAKITOUT{board}[move]
        HMM WATIF(cell == "X")
            UREPLACEIT{board}[move] W/cell
            SPITOUT("THAT SQUARE IS ALREADY X.")
            SKIPTIS
        HMM WATIF(cell == "O")
            UREPLACEIT{board}[move] W/cell
            SPITOUT("THAT SQUARE IS ALREADY O.")
            SKIPTIS
        UREPLACEIT{board}[move] W/turn
        FINALANSER(move)
    FINALANSER(-1)
}

IWANNACOMENT:
THE AI IS PURPOSELY WRITTEN THE LONG COSSERT WAY.
FIRST IT SEARCHES EVERY WINNING LINE FOR AN O-O-EMPTY PATTERN.
THEN IT SEARCHES EVERY LINE FOR X-X-EMPTY TO BLOCK THE HUMAN.
THEN IT USES A POSITION PREFERENCE.
NO JAVASCRIPT IS CHOOSING THE MOVE.
COMENT FINISH

ELLO "AIMOVE" YOUR NOW DOIN {
    GET "snapAI" LETITB SNAPSHOT()
    "aiMove" CHANGETO-> -1
    SPITOUT("AI IS THINKING IN COSSERT...")
    HMM WATIF(aiMove == -1)
        HMM WATIF(c0 == "O")
            HMM WATIF(c1 == "O")
                HMM WATIF(NO{c2 == "X"})
                    HMM WATIF(NO{c2 == "O"})
                        "aiMove" CHANGETO-> 2
                        SPITOUT("AI FOUND A WINNING MOVE.")
    HMM WATIF(aiMove == -1)
        HMM WATIF(c0 == "O")
            HMM WATIF(c2 == "O")
                HMM WATIF(NO{c1 == "X"})
                    HMM WATIF(NO{c1 == "O"})
                        "aiMove" CHANGETO-> 1
                        SPITOUT("AI FOUND A WINNING MOVE.")
    HMM WATIF(aiMove == -1)
        HMM WATIF(c1 == "O")
            HMM WATIF(c2 == "O")
                HMM WATIF(NO{c0 == "X"})
                    HMM WATIF(NO{c0 == "O"})
                        "aiMove" CHANGETO-> 0
                        SPITOUT("AI FOUND A WINNING MOVE.")
    HMM WATIF(aiMove == -1)
        HMM WATIF(c3 == "O")
            HMM WATIF(c4 == "O")
                HMM WATIF(NO{c5 == "X"})
                    HMM WATIF(NO{c5 == "O"})
                        "aiMove" CHANGETO-> 5
                        SPITOUT("AI FOUND A WINNING MOVE.")
